      "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate's gross claims outstanding at 1 January 2020 were GBP 379.4m. Analysis of the claims development triangle indicates a net release on prior years of approximately GBP 22.3m (gross), representing a ~5.9% reduction on opening gross reserves. The reserve movements reflect mixed development across older underwriting years (material favourable movement in 2018 netting against some adverse development in 2017), with the report highlighting significant natural catastrophe activity in 2020 and material Covid-19 related booked losses. The release reported here is derived from the gross claims development table as no single gross prior-year movement line was provided.",
